<title>HONG KONG: China Marine posts higher interim profit.</title>
<headline>China Marine posts higher interim profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		 0.531    vs 0.408</p>
<p>    Special item	     45.62    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  93.91    vs 66.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,359.52 vs 887.99</p>
<p>    Company name	     China International Marine Containers</p>
<p>				   (Group) Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - China International Marine is a container manufacturer.</p>
<p>The accounting policies adopted in preparing this interim report are consistent with those adopted in the last interim report. Figures contained in this report are verified according to the International Accounting Standard.</p>
<p>Net profit is after tax, minority interests and special items.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
